 "title": "Constructible sheaves",
 "statement": "A sheaf $\\mathcal F\\in\\shv{\\et X}$ is *constructible* if there is a\nstratification $(\\iota_k\\colon Z_k\\to X)_{k<n}$ of $X$ such that each\npullback $\\iota_k^*\\mathcal F$ is finite locally constant.",
